WEBVTT

00:13:59.676 --> 00:14:01.956
is something that's not working
for a lot of us.

00:14:01.956 --> 00:14:04.556
There's a thread throughout the book
around permission.

00:14:04.556 --> 00:14:06.836
I think we all have to give
ourselves permission

00:14:06.836 --> 00:14:09.236
and give each other permission
to talk about things

00:14:09.276 --> 00:14:12.396
that we're told not to talk about,
things we're taught to believe.

00:14:12.396 --> 00:14:16.396
And so much of what this book is about
is rewriting success and leadership.

00:14:16.436 --> 00:14:18.596
My parents were immigrants
to this country.

00:14:18.596 --> 00:14:21.636
So being the child of immigrants,
you are taught it to work hard

00:14:21.676 --> 00:14:24.876
and sacrifice a lot to kind of,
move ahead and find stability.

00:14:24.916 --> 00:14:27.076
And so I just think
it's part of understanding

00:14:27.116 --> 00:14:29.596
that some of these things
are things we're all taught

00:14:29.636 --> 00:14:31.836
and that we need
to rewrite them for everybody.